  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MALDIVES FISH SECTOR CAPACITY STRENGTHENING PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will contribute to the economic development of rural Islands and increase the livelihood of families.

The key results expected from the project by 2028 include:

&#x25aa;100 MT per day Brine freezing increased;

&#x25aa;1,500 MT Cold storage capacity increased;

&#x25aa;35 MT per day fish processing capacity for packaging increased;

&#x25aa;2 accommodation buildings constructed for decent shelters to 350 MIFCO staff and;

&#x25aa;215 staff and fishermen trained.</narrative>
  </description>
